        "content": "## TODO\n\nSSH command format\n\nn8n's Execute node forces \"cd <dir> ; \" before the\ncommand — Working Directory field is mandatory, no\nway around it client-side. Host's forced-command\nexpects a bare email, so every call gets refused.\n\nNeeds host-side fix: extract email via regex in the\nauthorized_keys command or in the script itself,\ninstead of assuming a bare argument.",
